#====================================================================
# DRAFT-libsndfile-1.2.2-harmonyos - CMakeAutoGen and focused CTest validation on OHOS
#====================================================================

id:                     E393
trigger_tool:           cmake|conan|ctest|llvm-readelf
phase:                  configure|build|testing
error_signature:        CMakeAutoGenScript.cmake|CMAKE_MODULE_PATH|selected upstream CTest|.codesign

severity:               2
category:               ohos, cmake, audio, ctest
match_keywords:         libsndfile, CMakeAutoGen, CMAKE_MODULE_PATH, ctest, binary-sign-tool, .codesign
title:                  CMakeAutoGen path repair and focused libsndfile CTest gate on OHOS

root_cause:             Conan can expose CMAKE_MODULE_PATH as a list, while the upstream CMake helper treated it as one directory. The full 143-case matrix also contains optional-codec and host-facility cases that are not deterministic in the OHOS package gate.
verification_cmd:       Run conan create; require the selected 12 upstream tests and the consumer WAV/PCM loop to pass; on OHOS inspect signed test ELFs for exactly one .codesign section.

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:            resolve-cmake-helper-relative-to-list-dir
rec_description:         Resolve CMakeAutoGenScript.cmake from CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR and keep an explicit inventory of selected and deferred upstream tests.
rec_command:             conan create archives/l/libsndfile/1.2.2 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix:            false
rec_impl:                conan-recipe|portability-patch|test-inventory

fallback_priority:       2
fallback_approach:       run-full-upstream-matrix-in-controlled-ohos-environment
fallback_description:    When optional codecs and host facilities are available, execute the complete upstream matrix and compare results with the focused gate.
fallback_command:        ctest --output-on-failure -j 1
fallback_auto_fix:       false
fallback_impl:            controlled-device-validation

forbid_1_pattern:         claim 143 tests passed when only 12 were selected
forbid_1_reason:          The remaining tests are not part of the deterministic OHOS gate and may require disabled dependencies or host facilities.
forbid_1_consequence:    Reviewers cannot distinguish executed coverage from deferred coverage.

